          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit ends an ingress move, while the unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Leader" id="9057-2862-d181-df67" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit gains the Leader ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Swift Onslaught" id="8107-f8be-9d24-5ac8" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">You can re-roll the Advance roll.
You can re-roll the Charge roll.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Sword of the Throne" id="fa71-5c90-4e6f-643c" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">-&gt; At the start of the battle round, if during the first battle round:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit, binding it as mark selection (your Mark target). When your Mark target is destroyed, you must select one enemy unit, binding it as mark selection to replace it. Only one such designation can be active for this bearer unit. For the rest of the battle, each time this model makes an attack against it, while that unit is tagged mark, this model gets +1 to Wound rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
