          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="4533-c2b5-5562-6a14" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Infernus Firebombs" id="3982-6a52-49dc-415a" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the end of your opponent's Fight phase, until the end of your next turn:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit (excluding AIRCRAFT units) without the Lone Operative ability visible to this model if the selected unit is within 24" of the unit:
    -&gt; Each time a ranged attack targets that unit, the attacking weapon has [IGNORES COVER].
    -&gt; Roll one D6 for each model in the selected unit: for each 6+, that unit suffers 1 mortal wound (to a maximum of 6 mortal wounds).</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Damaged" id="f35c-6b03-1839-9e1f" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the model has X or fewer wounds remaining, X being its rating, this model gets -1 to Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
