          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When a friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit embarked within the unit is selected to make a Disembark move using the Tactical Disembarkation rules, during the Movement phase, in your turn, until the end of the phase, the triggering unit is eligible to declare a charge even if it Advanced this turn.</characteristic>
