            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="450-a17e-9d5e-29da">2+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="750a-a2ec-90d3-21fe">10</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="LD" typeId="58d2-b879-49c7-43bc">5+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="OC" typeId="bef7-942a-1a23-59f8">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="InSv" typeId="55a7-5b54-c60d-11dc">5+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Base" typeId="nr-base-size">70x105mm</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="f180-eea3-45d3-dc25" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deep Strike" id="096f-0265-f66e-ebd3" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit ends an ingress move, while the unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Mobile Hunter" id="6140-7e72-828c-efb7" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After the unit resolves its attacks, you may use this ability, during the Shooting phase, in your turn, until the end of the turn:
  -&gt; The unit can make a Normal move of up to D6".
  -&gt; The unit cannot declare a charge.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
