        <profile name="Archeotech Teleport-shunter (Once per battle, per unit)" id="8fbd-9257-7e3a-3731" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">You can: Once per battle per unit, during the Movement phase, in your turn, while the unit is unengaged, unless the unit has been selected to move this phase, until the end of the phase:
