              <rules>
                <rule name="Talon Sortie" id="f10c-5102-7c13-e761" hidden="false">
                  <description>-&gt; Each time a friendly unit Falls Back (the triggering unit must have ADEPTUS CUSTODES): the triggering unit is eligible to declare a charge even if it Fell Back this turn.
While the Calistus option of Martial Katah is active, add 2 to the unit's Move characteristic.</description>
                </rule>
