              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">You can: Once per phase per army:
  -&gt; The unit is eligible to be targeted with the Rapid Ingress Stratagem even if it has already been targeted with that Stratagem this phase.
